			</div>
			<div class="content" id="post-content-4069530">
									

<p>Overall, I enjoyed this (except for maybe the test logs), but there's just one little thing my over-analytical computer geek mind found hard to overlook.</p>
<blockquote>
<p>SCP-4446 can not be deleted or edited. Any attempt to do so is prompted by an alert, that sufficient administrative rights are needed, even if executed as an admin.</p>
</blockquote>
<p>Admin isn't the highest permission level; root is. Also, why not just wipe the hard drive? That doesn't require any permissions at all.</p>

